# At each real milestone (this also shows you are alive), with your own number and words:
{{.Bin}} progress 40 "<what is done so far>"

# Blocked on a decision or a missing fact? Ask and WAIT. Give this command a 10-minute timeout.
# If it ends with "still open", run the resume command it prints, once. If that also ends with
# "still open", stop and wait: you will be told in this tab when the answer is there.
# Never guess instead of asking.
{{.Bin}} ask "<your question>"
# Only where the answer must be one of a few fixed words, add them: --options first,second

# Before each new file, and once before you report, read messages from the orchestrator:
{{.Bin}} mail

# Finished and checked by you? Write the result file, then exactly once:
{{.Bin}} report done "<three plain sentences of your own>"
# Could not finish:
{{.Bin}} report failed "<what went wrong>"
# Was your result sent back? The reason comes with `mail`. Mend the work and report done again.

